message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "arm-rc-ctrl: Reservoir-Computing Control for Robot Arms"
authors:
  - family-names: Atsuta
    given-names: Hiroshi
    email: atsuta@ieee.org
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/hrshtst/arm-rc-ctrl"
abstract: >-
  Research software investigating echo state network (reservoir computing)
  target generators for robot-arm control, from planar simulation with skelarm
  to the physical CRANE-X7 through rtctrl, with rclib providing the reservoir
  and readout implementations.
keywords:
  - reservoir computing
  - echo state network
  - robot arm
  - motor control
  - CRANE-X7
